      "source": "Uses of <a href=\"../ExecutorConfigurationSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\">ExecutorConfigurationSupport</a> in <a href=\"../package-summary.html\">org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent</a>",
      "translation": "`ExecutorConfigurationSupport` 在 `org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent` 包中的用法",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a> that sets up\na <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ScheduledExecutorService.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ScheduledExecutorService</code></a>\n(by default: a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ScheduledThreadPoolExecutor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ScheduledThreadPoolExecutor</code></a>)\nand exposes it for bean references.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a> 用于设置一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ScheduledExecutorService.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ScheduledExecutorService</code></a>（默认值：一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ScheduledThreadPoolExecutor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ScheduledThreadPoolExecutor</code></a>），并将其暴露以供 bean 引用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "JavaBean that allows for configuring a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ThreadPoolExecutor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ThreadPoolExecutor</code></a>\nin bean style (through its \"corePoolSize\", \"maxPoolSize\", \"keepAliveSeconds\",\n\"queueCapacity\" properties) and exposing it as a bean reference of its native\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ExecutorService.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ExecutorService</code></a> type.",
      "translation": "允许以 Bean 风格配置 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ThreadPoolExecutor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ThreadPoolExecutor</code></a>（通过其 \"corePoolSize\"、\"maxPoolSize\"、\"keepAliveSeconds\" 和 \"queueCapacity\" 属性）并将其作为原生类型 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ExecutorService.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ExecutorService</code></a> 的 Bean 引用暴露出来的 JavaBean。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "JavaBean that allows for configuring a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ThreadPoolExecutor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ThreadPoolExecutor</code></a>\nin bean style (through its \"corePoolSize\", \"maxPoolSize\", \"keepAliveSeconds\", \"queueCapacity\"\nproperties) and exposing it as a Spring <a href=\"../../../core/task/TaskExecutor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.task\"><code>TaskExecutor</code></a>.",
      "translation": "允许以 Bean 风格配置<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ThreadPoolExecutor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ThreadPoolExecutor</code></a>的 JavaBean（通过其\"corePoolSize\"、\"maxPoolSize\"、\"keepAliveSeconds\"、\"queueCapacity\"属性），并将其作为 Spring<a href=\"../../../core/task/TaskExecutor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.task\"><code>TaskExecutor</code></a>暴露出来。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A standard implementation of Spring's <a href=\"../../TaskScheduler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.scheduling\"><code>TaskScheduler</code></a> interface, wrapping\na native <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ScheduledThreadPoolExecutor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ScheduledThreadPoolExecutor</code></a> and providing\nall applicable configuration options for it.",
      "translation": "Spring 的 <a href=\"../../TaskScheduler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.scheduling\"><code>TaskScheduler</code></a> 接口的标准实现，封装了原生的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ScheduledThreadPoolExecutor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ScheduledThreadPoolExecutor</code></a>，并提供其所有适用的配置选项。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Scheduling convenience classes for the <code>java.util.concurrent</code>\nand <code>jakarta.enterprise.concurrent</code> packages, allowing to set up a\nThreadPoolExecutor or ScheduledThreadPoolExecutor as a bean in a Spring\ncontext.",
      "translation": "为 `<code>java.util.concurrent</code>` 和 `<code>jakarta.enterprise.concurrent</code>` 包中的调度便利类，允许在 Spring 上下文中将 `ThreadPoolExecutor` 或 `ScheduledThreadPoolExecutor` 配置为 Bean。",
      "count": 1
    }
